          SIZE 16 BY 1
          BGCOLOR 15 FGCOLOR 9 
     Proveedor.contacto AT ROW 3.86 COL 15 COLON-ALIGNED
          VIEW-AS FILL-IN 
          SIZE 59 BY 1
          BGCOLOR 15 FGCOLOR 9 
     Proveedor.cdg_viapago AT ROW 3.86 COL 85 COLON-ALIGNED
          LABEL "Pago Vía"
          VIEW-AS COMBO-BOX INNER-LINES 5
          LIST-ITEM-PAIRS "Item 1","Item 1"
          DROP-DOWN-LIST
          SIZE 42 BY 1
          BGCOLOR 15 FGCOLOR 9 
     Proveedor.orden_cheque AT ROW 5.05 COL 15 COLON-ALIGNED FORMAT "X(100)"
          VIEW-AS FILL-IN 
