          DROP-DOWN-LIST
          SIZE 50 BY 1
          BGCOLOR 15 FGCOLOR 9 
     v-cdg_grupo-empresario AT ROW 8.62 COL 15 COLON-ALIGNED
     v-dsc_grupo-empresario AT ROW 8.62 COL 28 COLON-ALIGNED HELP
          "Denominacion" NO-LABEL
     Proveedor.cdg_condiva AT ROW 8.62 COL 77 COLON-ALIGNED
          VIEW-AS COMBO-BOX INNER-LINES 5
          LIST-ITEM-PAIRS "0",0
          DROP-DOWN-LIST
          SIZE 50 BY 1
          BGCOLOR 15 FGCOLOR 9 
    WITH 1 DOWN NO-BOX KEEP-TAB-ORDER OVERLAY 
         SIDE-LABELS NO-UNDERLINE THREE-D 
         AT COL 1 ROW 1 SCROLLABLE 
         FONT 4.

/* DEFINE FRAME statement is approaching 4K Bytes.  Breaking it up   */
